{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/815309-what-can-you-do-with-prehensile-tail","id":815309,"title":"What can you do with prehensile tail?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-24T01:38:25-08:00","id":815309,"title":"What can you do with prehensile tail?","content":"Ok, i can see how you could use the prehensile tail from protean 2, too trip someone while your tied up or something, but it seems to be a super situational power. I could see justification for grappling being easier, but i can't find any supporting rules for that. I am sure people have come up with some creative uses, and i would be delighted too hear them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6947-cubleds","name":"cubleds","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T02:16:09-08:00","id":815321,"title":"","content":"What CAN'T you do with it? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> A prehensile tail is like a monkey's tail, a tentacle, or an elephant's trunk. You don't have super fine dexterity, so no lock picking or surgery, but you can grab objects, flip switches, tap on keyboards, hang from trees, use it for balance like a cat's, propel yourself in water a bit faster . . . The list goes on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T05:26:56-08:00","id":815372,"title":"","content":"Protean is a swiss army knife. It has a bunch of tools for various jobs. The cork screw on that swiss army knife might be a bit silly and situational, but its there because its possible you could use it. That's the point of a swiss army knife.<br /> <br /> I've used the tail to help with stealing things. Distract with hands, target doesn't see tail swiping things. Add Vigor to grapple with! Once I used it to make a threat with, pulling a knife and pointing it at someone's throat while sitting and reading a book and &quot;not looking up.&quot; That was fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T08:01:50-08:00","id":815456,"title":"","content":"Do keep in mind that the intention is to pick three abilities that mimic a specific predatory animal, as per Predatory Aspect's final paragraph. You aren't meant to just pick the best three options.<br /> <br /> So the tail has uses, but it doesn't really have to be perfectly balanced with the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T08:25:54-08:00","id":815474,"title":"","content":"Or you could make a demon form. Claws and wings and tail and horns, oh my!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T00:26:10-08:00","id":817455,"title":"","content":"Daeva+Prehensile tail","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T01:03:22-08:00","id":817467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/815309-what-can-you-do-with-prehensile-tail?p=815474#post815474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or you could make a demon form. Claws and wings and tail and horns, oh my!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think that comes with Protean 4, but the first three should make sense","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}